The RHEL/Alma/Rocky + EPEL 10 configs have been switched from the epel-z-10
template to the epel-10 template.  This is related to a minor reconfiguration
of EPEL 10 minor version repo redirects.  See [this discussion
thread](https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/looking-back-at-epel-10-and-forward-to-epel-11/197373)
for more details.
